    <string name="settings_src_mail_outlook_steps">Outlook sign-in uses an app you register yourself in Microsoft Entra (free, once; this hub keeps using it):\n1. Open entra.microsoft.com with a Microsoft account, App registrations → New registration;\n2. Supported account types: accounts in any organizational directory and personal Microsoft accounts;\n3. Redirect URI platform: Public client/native (mobile &amp; desktop), with the address above;\n4. Under Authentication, set Allow public client flows to Yes;\n5. Under API permissions, add IMAP.AccessAsUser.All and SMTP.Send (delegated);\n6. Enter the Application (client) ID from the Overview page here.\nSee docs/extensions/mail.md, Outlook, for the details.</string>
